abstract: "Work in progress (pre-registration; protocols not yet frozen). A reproducible simulation study of fixed, occupancy-based and demand-responsive pricing for perishable inventory. No findings yet. Developed with an AI research and development assistant (Claude Code), which is not an author."
keywords:
